    "body": "The summary for PMPCFG_WARL claims PMP CSRs are “accessible only in M-mode”, but the rule’s tags no longer include the corresponding normative tag (norm:pmp_csr_mode). This makes the definition internally inconsistent and can produce generated output that doesn’t match the summary. Either drop the M-mode accessibility clause from the summary, or add norm:pmp_csr_mode to the tags (and consider whether pmp_csr_mode should remain a separate rule).\n```suggestion\n    tags: [\"norm:pmp_csrs_warl_access\", \"norm:pmp_rwx_warl\", \"norm:pmp_csr_mode\"]\n```",
